\par \pard\li175 \f4\cf1 
\par Some reactors are more efficient than others. You will notice, while in the Herc Bay, that some reactors raise a Herc\'92s Speed Rating, while others lower it, even though every reactor upgrade increases the total amount of power available to a Herc.
\par \b Fission\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 reliably provides high levels of clean energy.
\par \b Ion\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 reactor output increased through less protection for the safer ion fuel.
\par \b Matter Conversion\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 power output is reduced through numerous safeguards. Nevertheless, this reactor is more efficient than the Ion reactor.
